{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_05",
  "title": "曲徑求勝",
  "storyCode": "DH-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "47fe6dbb38f7ec19fd1d186f4366719ecfbd875ec0b27ca22fa04ff9db42c314",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "隨著比賽的進行，先頭部隊已經通過了騎行檢查點，而就在這時，比賽也迎來了一些變化！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "在第一輪比賽中大顯神威的鼠膽龍威隊，在通過了騎行檢查點並騎上了車後，立刻就遭到了其他隊伍的重點照顧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "而且，這一次他們似乎改變了策略。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "坎黛拉女士，能否請您為大家講解一下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "這不明擺著嗎，這幫人知道自己就算一起上也未必是這支隊伍的對手，於是選擇拖住他們的腳步，而不是打敗他們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "跑步環節即使用這種方法也很容易被這兩人近身，但是騎行階段，在車上很多招式不好施展。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "所以他們選擇在騎行環節這麼做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "不得不說，效果不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "確實，他們緊緊跟在鼠膽龍威隊附近，不上前進攻，只用各種手段進行騷擾，讓鼠膽龍威隊無法安心地趕路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "我們看到，鼠膽龍威隊現在已經落後先頭部隊許多了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "騎在車上施展不開，而下車只會落後！鼠膽龍威隊，面臨著比賽開始以來最大的危機！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "他們的目的不是打敗我們，是拖住我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "怎麼辦，兩位，騎行中戰鬥是很困難的，這樣下去我們要被完全拖住了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "（小聲）看來，有人想讓我們抄近道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "（小聲）我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "（小聲）闖一闖？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "（小聲）呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "為了擺脫阻礙自己的其他隊伍選手，鼠膽龍威隊選擇了插入巷道之中！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "但是，正如我們在別的舞台所看到的，在巷道中，等待著我們的選手的，是這座城市的精銳部隊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "雖然我也想為各位講解其他隊伍的視角，但是鼠膽龍威隊實在是太吸引人注目了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "鼠膽龍威隊此舉究竟是自尋死路，還是險中求勝，讓我們拭目以待！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "各位，走這邊！這條巷子很隱秘，我估計沒人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "當心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在埃內斯托回頭的一瞬間，一支弩箭從角落處向他激射而來，卻被林雨霞用手刀截開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伏兵A",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伏兵B",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "兩位，這裡交給我，你們快走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "埃內斯托說著將一把鑰匙丟給陳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "（小聲）這把鑰匙你們拿著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "（小聲）那邊有一家我開的武器店，你們過去應該就能看到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "（小聲）武器店的地下室有一扇後門，從後門出去有一個地下行道，走那邊會快很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "（小聲）我在這裡拖住他們，你們先走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......你一個人沒問題？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "只要有一個人到達終點就算勝利，兩位，你們先走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "先突破這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
